ngth $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nIn the given equation, we have ${a}^{2}=\\frac{5}{9}$ and ${b}^{2}=\\frac{5}{16}.$\n\n- Since ${a}^{2}=\\frac{5}{9},$ the length of the horizontal radius must be $a=\\sqrt{\\frac{5}{9}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}.$\n\n- Since ${b}^{2}=\\frac{5}{16},$ the length of the vertical radius must be $b=\\sqrt{\\frac{5}{16}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{4}.$\n\nSo the semi-major axis has length $a=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3},$ and the semi-minor axis has length $b=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{4}.$\n\nTherefore, the major axis has length $2a=2\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}=\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{3},$ and the minor axis has length $2b=2\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{4}=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["789ce64e-9b22-5c24-afe7-9c36ade69dd0"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "04d91d80-00a0-5bbb-a10c-82542b32e2f7" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186087841.py"} [:db/add 17592186087841 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] {:db/id 17592186087841 :knowledge-point/questions ["a8e4213c-472e-5df6-a92b-8b65321f34cc" "3a6ef55b-f35c-5e25-8e8b-c766bf7961eb" "e487ead8-2208-53bd-a890-504c42fca111" "d560ab9f-5f69-5c94-a9a1-63ff925308ba" "c3eafdd8-07a8-5eeb-996a-7c5b2fca35e0" "5cca8aca-b32e-5ccf-8a3f-4520b45e3d49" "81fb6273-5dee-5beb-bfc9-3f4b77ae324c" "071541e3-e659-523c-b1f4-eade008267f7" "3f4b4f77-3a6a-59e9-8972-8eb1480893b3" "5c19ea88-4652-5feb-b49c-a5fe7156da75"]} [:db/ensure 17592186087841 :knowledge-point/validate]]
